WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.720
Hello, everyone. Welcome
to Mission and Margin.

2
00:00:04.059 --> 00:00:09.880
In this session, we'll focus on financial
fluency, which is a cornerstone of

3
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:14.720
effective leadership. At Vanderbilt,
we know that mission without margin is

4
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:18.500
unsustainable, and margin
without mission is meaningless.

5
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:21.320
Leaders must be fluent in both.

6
00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:25.200
Financial fluency is
not about becoming CFOs.

7
00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:30.740
It's about understanding how our decisions
shape the resources that make our mission

8
00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:36.460
possible. The stronger our financial
fluency, the bolder we can be in

9
00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:39.160
research, discovery, and education.

10
00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:43.880
In this session, you'll see how mission
and margin work together and how every

11
00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:46.500
leader plays a role in sustaining them.

12
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:51.780
The goal is simple: to give you the tools
to make sound choices that protect our

13
00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:58.020
mission and maintain the financial strength that will help secure Vanderbilt's place

14
00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:01.420
as the great university of
the twenty-first century.
